Package: webr
Title: WebR Support Package
Version: 0.2.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("George", "Stagg", , "george.stagg@posit.co", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Lionel", "Henry", , "lionel@posit.co", role = "aut"),
    person("Posit Software, PBC", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
  )
Description: An R package to act as an interface to webR and provide
    supporting functions.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/r-wasm/webr
BugReports: https://github.com/r-wasm/webr/issues
Imports: utils
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
